  store: {
    initialState: initialStateObject,
    reducers: reducersMap,
    middlewares: [loggerMiddleware],
    enhancers: [applyMiddleware('myMiddleWare')]
  },
  context: MyContext,                     // your React context provider
  hooks: {
    useStateSelectorHook,                 // hook to read state
    useDispatchActionHook                // hook to dispatch actions
  }
});
```

This single line creates the store, context, and custom hooks for your React application, wiring in the initial state, reducers, logger middleware, and the `applyMiddleware('myMiddleWare')` enhancer.

